        "original_id": "7123ed57-773f-5ffa-bf2d-88eaa93d0134",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Places: Battle Born Studios, Winchester, Nevada, Las Vegas Township, Clark County, Nevada, Las Vegas Strip\n- Organizations: The Killers, Imagine Dragons\n- People: Aja Volkman, Dan Reynolds\n- Products: Hell and Silence, Egyptian\n- Concepts: recording studios, EPs, music duos, monikers\n\nFacts:\n- Winchester is an unincorporated town and census-designated place in Las Vegas Township, Clark County, Nevada, United States, and it contains part of the Las Vegas Strip.\n- Battle Born Studios is a 2000 square foot recording studio located in Winchester, Nevada.\n- The Killers own Battle Born Studios.\n- Hell and Silence was recorded at Battle Born Studios.\n- Aja Volkman released an EP titled \"Egyptian\" as a duo with her husband Dan Reynolds under the moniker Egyptian.\n- Dan Reynolds is associated with Imagine Dragons.",
